        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Egil Storholt, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet\n- Places: Trondheim, Norway\n- Concepts: speed skating, the \"four S-es\"\n\nFacts:\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born on 13 February 1949.\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born in Trondheim, Norway.\n- Jan Egil Storholt is a former speed skater from Norway.\n- In the 1970s and early 1980s, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, and Jan Egil Storholt were known as the legendary \"four S-es,\" a group of contemporary top Norwegian skaters.\n- In 2013, Trondheim was the third largest city in Norway, with 169,972 inhabitants within the city borders.",
